{% comment %}
  Priced with honesty: a like-for-like comparison against a genuine, currently
  available competitor product.

  Our prices come from Shopify so they can never drift. The benchmark prices are
  fixed here and stamped with the date they were verified, because a stale price
  comparison is a false claim. Evidence, method and the claims we may not make:
  docs/price-comparison-evidence.md

  Re-verify before every release. If the benchmark drops below our price, delete
  the entry rather than leave the module up.

  benchmark_prices is index-aligned with the product's size variants.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign show_comparison = false
  assign benchmark_prices = ''

  assign our_glass = ''

  case product.handle
    when 'brook-champagne-gold-wall-mirror', 'brook-matte-black-wall-mirror'
      assign show_comparison = true
      assign benchmark_prices = '306,408'
      assign our_glass = '4 mm, copper-free and lead-free'
    when 'solenne-champagne-gold-full-length-mirror'
      assign show_comparison = true
      assign benchmark_prices = '1122'
      assign our_glass = '5 mm, copper-free and lead-free'
  endcase

  assign benchmark_name = 'A comparable designer mirror'
  assign benchmark_note = 'Same size, same materials, shipped to the UK from the United States.'
  assign checked_on = '10 July 2026'
-%}

{%- if show_comparison -%}
  {%- assign bm_list = benchmark_prices | split: ',' -%}

  <section class="pricehonest" aria-labelledby="pricehonest-title">
    <div class="pricehonest-head">
      <span class="pricehonest-eyebrow">Priced with honesty</span>
      <h2 class="pricehonest-title" id="pricehonest-title">The same mirror costs more elsewhere</h2>
      <p class="pricehonest-sub">We hold our stock in the UK and sell it to you directly. {{ benchmark_note }}</p>
    </div>

    <table class="pricehonest-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col"><span class="pricehonest-vh">Comparison</span></th>
          <th scope="col" class="pricehonest-us">MUNLER</th>
          <th scope="col">{{ benchmark_name }}</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {%- assign size_idx = 0 -%}
        {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
          {%- assign vt = variant.title | downcase -%}
          {%- unless vt == 'default title' -%}
            {%- assign bm = bm_list[size_idx] -%}
            {%- if bm -%}
              {%- assign bm_money = bm | times: 100 | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
              {%- assign size_label = variant.title | split: ' - ' | first -%}
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">{{ size_label }}</th>
                <td class="pricehonest-us pricehonest-price">{{ variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</td>
                <td class="pricehonest-price pricehonest-price--them">{{ bm_money }}</td>
              </tr>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign size_idx = size_idx | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- endunless -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Frame</th>
          <td class="pricehonest-us">304-grade stainless steel</td>
          <td>Stainless steel</td>
        </tr>
        {%- comment -%}
          Their glass thickness is only evidenced for the Brook comparator, so we
          do not state a thickness for theirs at all. Copper-free is their own claim.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Glass</th>
          <td class="pricehonest-us">{{ our_glass }}</td>
          <td>Copper-free real glass</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Warranty</th>
          <td class="pricehonest-us">5 years</td>
          <td>Not stated</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Ships from</th>
          <td class="pricehonest-us">United Kingdom</td>
          <td>United States</td>
        </tr>
        {%- comment -%}
          We have not evidenced their UK delivery charge, so we do not characterise it.
          State only our own terms here.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">UK delivery</th>
          <td class="pricehonest-us">Free, insured, tracked</td>
          <td>Not stated</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p class="pricehonest-foot">
      The materials are comparable. The difference is that you are not paying to fly a mirror
      across the Atlantic. Competitor list prices taken from their own UK storefront on {{ checked_on }}.
    </p>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
